<heading>find - Find categories by name.</heading>

<rule/>

<heading level="2">
Usage
</heading>

<pre>
  find TEXT
</pre>

<heading level="2">
Description
</heading>

<paragraph>
Finds categories whose name contains TEXT (case-insensitive
substring match). No ranking, no fuzzy matching.
</paragraph>

<heading level="2">
Examples
</heading>

<pre>
find hist
  Find categories containing 'hist'.
</pre>

<heading level="2">
See also
</heading>

<paragraph>
list, add
</paragraph>
